# Wio-E5 Mini + Gateway Loopback Simulation
# RENODE-PHASE2: Two-machine simulation with UART bridge
#
# This script is a placeholder. The full implementation requires:
# 1. UART-to-UART connection between Wio-E5 USART1 and gateway FC5 LPUART5
# 2. SX126x Python peripheral for LoRa radio simulation
# 3. Robot Framework test integration
#
# Usage (when implemented):
#   renode wio_e5_mini_loopback.resc --disable-xwt

$name?="wio_e5_mini_loopback"
$gateway_bin?=@gateway.elf
$lora_bridge_bin?=@lora_bridge.elf
$gateway_repl?=$ORIGIN/../frdm_mcxn947_mcxn947_cpu0.repl
$lora_bridge_repl?=$ORIGIN/wio_e5_mini.repl

using sysbus

# Gateway machine
mach create "gateway"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $gateway_repl

# LoRa bridge machine
mach create "lora_bridge"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $lora_bridge_repl

# TODO: Connect gateway FC5 LPUART5 to lora_bridge USART1
# TODO: Connect lora_bridge USART1 to gateway FC5 LPUART5
# Renode UART connection pattern:
#   connector Connect uart1 usart1

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $gateway_bin
    lora_bridge.sysbus LoadELF $lora_bridge_bin
"""
